propsSchema.description:
Runs a DuckDB query and exposes its result as a named SQL source. Any SQL widget in reach of this node (the same node, or one connected by an edge) references the result via {{name}}; children are rendered as given.

## Example

```json
{
  "type": "sql-runner",
  "props": {
    "name": "filtered_data",
    "sql": "SELECT * FROM {{my_udf}} WHERE price < $max_price",
    "maxRows": 10000
  },
  "children": [
    { "type": "bar-chart", "props": { "sql": "SELECT category AS label, COUNT(*) AS value FROM {{filtered_data}} GROUP BY 1" } }
  ]
}
```
